
# <type>(<optional area>): <short description>
#
# Types:
#   feat      new feature              feat(media): add comments button
#   fix       bug fix                  fix(player): stop crash on empty playlist
#   refactor  cleanup, same behaviour  refactor(media): replace untyped maps
#   chore     tooling / config         chore: pin Flutter with FVM
#   docs      documentation only       docs: update README
#   test      tests only              test(auth): cover logout
#   ci        GitHub Actions           ci: run tests on push
#
# Rules: lowercase after the colon, imperative ("add" not "added"),
# first line under ~72 characters. Optional body after a blank line.
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
